7. Performance Evaluation
What is Evaluation?

Measuring model quality.

Metrics
Accuracy

Formula:

Accuracy=
Total Predictions
Correct Predictions
	​

×100

Example:

Correct = 95
Total = 100

Accuracy = 95%
Precision

Measures correct positive predictions.

Formula:

TP / (TP + FP)
Recall

Measures how many actual positives are detected.

Formula:

TP / (TP + FN)
F1 Score

Balance between Precision and Recall.

Formula:

2 × (Precision × Recall)
-------------------------
 Precision + Recall
Confusion Matrix
	Predicted Positive	Predicted Negative
Actual Positive	TP	FN
Actual Negative	FP	TN

Where:

TP = True Positive
TN = True Negative
FP = False Positive
FN = False Negative

